{
 "annotations": {
  "destructiveHint": false,
  "idempotentHint": false,
  "openWorldHint": false,
  "readOnlyHint": false
 },
 "description": "Scene-level \"shootability\" diagnosis for a screenplay, using the same ai-2.0 rules as narracore.cn: YOU (the calling AI) cite the evidence, the server validates it and computes the score \u2014 no LLM on the server. Two steps: (1) mode=\"material\" (FREE) returns each scene as a numbered block list ([n] [type] text), the strict findings JSON schema, and 6 problem types (abstract_psychology, literary_summary, unfilmable_information, unclear_space, weak_visible_action, unplayable_direction); (2) after analyzing the material yourself, call mode=\"score\" with findings=[{scene, summary, problems:[{type, severity(low|medium|high), evidence (verbatim quote from the material), blocks (ordinals), suggestion}]}]. The server maps ordinals to blocks, drops any finding whose evidence cannot be verified (that scene then scores null \u2014 never faked), and computes each scene's 0-100 score (severity-weighted evidence coverage, exact arithmetic) plus a reference-only structural baseline. One credit covers one screenplay for 24 hours across the screenplay tools. Failed calls are never charged. \u5267\u672c\u9010\u573a\u5f71\u89c6\u5316\u5ea6\u8bca\u65ad\uff1aAI \u4e3e\u8bc1\u3001\u7a0b\u5e8f\u7b97\u5206\uff080-100\uff0c\u8bc1\u636e\u6838\u9a8c\uff0c\u65e0\u6548\u5373\u7a7a\u4e0d\u5192\u5145\uff09\u3002",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
 "inputSchema": {
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "properties": {
   "blocks": {
    "items": {
     "properties": {
      "delivery": {
       "maxLength": 120,
       "type": "string"
      },
      "id": {
       "maxLength": 64,
       "type": "string"
      },
      "location": {
       "maxLength": 120,
       "type": "string"
      },
      "scene_number": {
       "maxLength": 16,
       "type": "string"
      },
      "speaker": {
       "maxLength": 64,
       "type": "string"
      },
      "text": {
       "maxLength": 200000,
       "type": "string"
      },
      "time_of_day": {
       "maxLength": 16,
       "type": "string"
      },
      "type": {
       "enum": [
        "scene_heading",
        "action",
        "character",
        "parenthetical",
        "dialogue",
        "transition",
        "shot",
        "note"
       ],
       "type": "string"
      }
     },
     "required": [
      "type"
     ],
     "type": "object"
    },
    "maxItems": 2000,
    "type": "array"
   },
   "findings": {
    "description": "score mode only: your per-scene findings",
    "items": {
     "properties": {
      "problems": {
       "description": "Problems you found, with verbatim evidence",
       "items": {
        "properties": {
         "blocks": {
          "description": "Block ordinals [n] the evidence came from",
          "items": {
           "maximum": 9007199254740991,
           "minimum": -9007199254740991,
           "type": "integer"
          },
          "maxItems": 8,
          "type": "array"
         },
         "evidence": {
          "description": "Verbatim quote from the scene material",
          "maxLength": 400,
          "type": "string"
         },
         "severity": {
          "description": "low | medium | high",
          "enum": [
           "low",
           "medium",
           "high"
          ],
          "type": "string"
         },
         "suggestion": {
          "maxLength": 400,
          "type": "string"
         },
         "type": {
          "description": "One of the 6 problem types from mode=\"material\"",
          "enum": [
           "abstract_psychology",
           "literary_summary",
           "unfilmable_information",
           "unclear_space",
           "weak_visible_action",
           "unplayable_direction"
          ],
          "type": "string"
         }
        },
        "required": [
         "type",
         "severity",
         "evidence"
        ],
        "type": "object"
       },
       "maxItems": 20,
       "type": "array"
      },
      "scene": {
       "description": "Scene number as returned by mode=\"material\"",
       "maximum": 9007199254740991,
       "minimum": 1,
       "type": "integer"
      },
      "summary": {
       "description": "Your 1-2 sentence summary of the scene",
       "maxLength": 400,
       "type": "string"
      }
     },
     "required": [
      "scene",
      "summary",
      "problems"
     ],
     "type": "object"
    },
    "maxItems": 200,
    "type": "array"
   },
   "input_format": {
    "description": "text (default): line-based screenplay text. blocks: typed blocks (e.g. from format_screenplay).",
    "enum": [
     "text",
     "blocks"
    ],
    "type": "string"
   },
   "license_key": {
    "description": "License key NRC-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX (optional \u2014 free daily quota works without one)",
    "pattern": "^NRC-[A-Z2-9]{4}(-[A-Z2-9]{4}){3}$",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "mode": {
    "description": "material (free): numbered scene material + schema. score: submit findings, server validates and scores.",
    "enum": [
     "material",
     "score"
    ],
    "type": "string"
   },
   "request_id": {
    "description": "Idempotency key (optional)",
    "maxLength": 64,
    "type": "string"
   },
   "scenes": {
    "description": "material mode only: scene numbers (1-based) to render; default all",
    "items": {
     "maximum": 9007199254740991,
     "minimum": 1,
     "type": "integer"
    },
    "maxItems": 200,
    "type": "array"
   },
   "text": {
    "maxLength": 200000,
    "minLength": 1,
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "required": [
   "mode"
  ],
  "type": "object"
 },
